text.en:
For purposes of effecting a total reorganization, including, if necessary, the creation of subsidiaries and
of a separate nuclear power company, the National Power Board is hereby authorized and directed to:
a. Group, coordinate, consolidate or integrate positions and functions in NAPOCOR;
b. Create, classify, split and abolish positions;
c. Promulgate and adopt policies and measures necessary to allow decentralized operation and the
establishment of subsidiaries and separate nuclear company pursuant to existing laws and loan covenants; and
d. Adopt a just and equitable program for the benefit of officials and employees who may be phased out from
NAPOCOR by reason of the reorganization;
